{
  "what": "The declared held-out homophonic screen: the counted pairs of every stream - the real, the plants, the floors and the seven band members of the first screen - are split by declared pair-index parity into a climb half the machinery may search and a score half it may never touch. The search is the exact greedy reassignment climb, declared when the first screen's candidate rule was found inexact away from the current label; its add-one exploitation is disclosed as systematic across the split, so this instrument prices the data-specific component only, and an exact full-data side call is recorded for attribution. The declared seeds of the first screen are replayed unchanged; nothing is redrawn and no mapping is published; nothing here is a reading.",
  "declared": {
    "base_seed": 20261020,
    "mapped": 36,
    "restarts": 16,
    "sweep_cap": 200,
    "plants_per_cell": 5,
    "floors": 5,
    "split_rule": "the counted pairs of each side, in stream order, split by pair-index parity: even indices form the climb half the machinery may search, odd indices the score half it may never touch; the halves share no counted pair and together they are the flat list, while across the halves adjacent pairs share a symbol position by construction (every interior position carries one climbed pair and one scored pair), so the score half is fresh to the search in the pair sense but not an independent sample of the stream; the split is deterministic and consumes no seed; both halves' sizes are recorded per cell",
    "machinery_rule": "the exact greedy reassignment climb: candidates are the exact new totals with the symbol's self-pair correction included, the running best is itself exact, and adoption needs a strict improvement beyond 1e-12; the climb runs only on the climb half, restart 0 the rank initialisation computed from the climb half, restarts 1 onward seeded permutations of the 27 letter tokens under the wrap rule, the best restart the best exact climb-half total with ties to the first restart; the held-out number is the chosen assignment's mean nats per scored pair on the score half, evaluated exactly; no assignment is stored",
    "seed_kinds": {
      "real": 1,
      "homo_plant": [
        24,
        25
      ],
      "homo_floor": [
        26,
        27
      ],
      "homo_cross": [
        28,
        29
      ]
    },
    "seed_sharing": "no new kinds are consumed; the first screen's declared draws are replayed from the declared kinds and the split adds no draw",
    "anchor_rule": "a plant's or member's anchor is its true configuration's mean nats per pair on the score half, algebraically the truncated stream's odd-half identity mean under the declared table, recorded with the climb-half identity mean",
    "plant_rule": "a plant passes at or above its anchor minus 0.0001 on the held-out statistic; an exact pass counts as parity; best above the anchor counts as parity with the excess recorded as machinery-above-anchor; a plant below the anchor by more than 0.0001 fails parity",
    "band_rule": "membership is unconditional as the first screen; a member's band value is the held-out value of the draw whose exact climb-half total is best among its five draws, ties to the first draw; the smallest member value sets the band threshold for its cell",
    "side_instrument": "the identical exact climb over the unsplit full data, recorded for attribution; no verdict is built on it",
    "verdict_rule": "real held-out at or above the smallest member band value is consistent-with-substitution; real held-out at or below the largest floor's held-out value is not-consistent; strictly between is below-held-band; machinery-noise-unresolved is retained formally for a memberless band, which cannot arise",
    "exclusion_rule": "if the real text stands below the smallest member band value in all six cells with plant parity green and every floor's held-out value below the real, the scoped homophonic class is excluded by count for the measured statistics, with the standing caveats",
